                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1] Great, short, thought provoking visual novel [/h1]\n\nJust finished the whole visual novel and it was a great read. The convesation and interaction between the characters was well done and each of the main characters stood out. It was short, took around 1.4 hours for me to complete, but it is very thought provoking and had me questioning Lily until the end. \n\nThis is different from the visual novels that I usually read since this takes a more serious topic compared to the usual more romance/comedy type and does it well in a visual novel format. \n\nIt was a great experience and will definitely remain on my mind for a while.\n\n[b] sorry I don't do reviews much but i'm trying anyway. [/b]\n",
